SUMMARY:AYPROS Mug Club: Affogato + Free Headshots
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\nJoin AYPROS for our Au
 gust Mug Club at Affogato\, the new gelato and espresso café inside Gemel
 li in Biltmore Village.\n\nMug Club is pretty much Pub Club in the morning
 . Coffee instead of cocktails\, an earlier bedtime\, and the same relaxed 
 opportunity to catch up with familiar faces and meet other young professio
 nals from across the Asheville area.\n\nThis month\, the first 20 attendee
 s will also receive a complimentary professional headshot from Ruth Cepero
  Photography (@ruthceperophotography). Come ready for an updated photo\, o
 r just stop by for coffee and good company before heading into the workday
 .\n\nMug Club is intentionally casual. Leave your business cards at home\,
  come as you are\, and enjoy a morning of conversation\, camaraderie\, and
  community without any pressure or agenda. Whether you have been coming to
  AYPROS events for years\, are joining us for the first time\, or are show
 ing up on your own\, you will be in good company.\n\nYour first morning be
 verage is on us. Additional drinks\, breakfast items\, and other menu offe
 rings will be available for purchase.\n\nThis is a come-and-go event\, so 
 arrive when you can and stay as long as your morning allows.\n\n## What to
  Expect\n\n• A relaxed\, come-and-go morning at Affogato\n• Your first
  morning beverage on us\n• A complimentary professional headshot for the
  first 20 attendees\n• Additional food and drinks available for purchase
 \n• Plenty of time to catch up with friends and meet new people\n• No 
 formal program\, presentations\, or pressure\n\n## Location\n\nAffogato at
  Gemelli\n28 Hendersonville Road\nAsheville\, NC 28803\n\n## Date\n\nThurs
 day\, August 13\n\n## Time\n\n8:00 AM - 10:00 AM\nCome for free delicious 
 coffee\, update your headshot\, and start the day with good conversation a
 nd good people.
