SUMMARY:AYPROS End-of-Summer Grill Out
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\nWe can’t believe it
 ’s already here! So long\, sweet summer!\n\nBefore the days get shorter 
 and everyone’s calendars fill back up\, join AYPROS for a summer send of
 f by the pool. AYPROS Board Member Scott Elliott is hosting us at the Bilt
 more Park Clubhouse and Pool for an end-of-summer grill out filled with go
 od food\, swimming\, familiar faces\, new friends\, and plenty of time to 
 relax.\n\nThis is a completely free\, kid-friendly event\, so bring the fa
 mily and make an afternoon of it. Whether you have been part of AYPROS for
  years\, recently joined\, or are coming to your first event\, this will b
 e an easygoing chance to spend time with Asheville’s young professional 
 community without a formal program\, pressure\, or agenda.\n\nAYPROS will 
 provide the grilled meats\, buns\, condiments\, and all the fixings. We ar
 e asking everyone to help complete the cookout table by bringing a side di
 sh\, dessert\, drinks\, or a bag of ice to share. Homemade\, store-bought\
 , a family recipe\, or something you grabbed on the way over are all equal
 ly welcome.\n\n## Event Details\n\n**8/16/26**\n**12:00 - 4:00 PM**\n\n**B
 iltmore Park Clubhouse and Pool**\n1067 Columbine Road\nAsheville\, NC 288
 03\n\n## What to Bring\n\nSwimsuits if you're going swim.\nPlease bring on
 e of the following to share:\n\n* A side dish\n* A dessert\n* Drinks\n* Ic
 e chests\n* A bag of ice\n\nScott Elliott will provide the meats and fixin
 gs.\n\n## Parking\n\nA paved parking lot is located directly at the Biltmo
 re Park Clubhouse and Pool. Parking is limited\, so please carpool with fr
 iends or family when possible.\n![](https://aypros.wildapricot.org/resourc
 es/Pictures/BiltmorePark(22).jpg)\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!
